Going well, everyone has been really helpful. First observations:

- Most final test fails I've seen are mechanical, not electrical: bus cables pinched at the wrist, horns not seated on the spline, one servo with the wrong ID.
- New servos all ship with ID 1, so if someone forgets to set the ID before mounting, the arm shows up with two motors on ID 1 and the scan fails.
- The three line laptops have three different LeRobot versions installed. I'd like to pin one version for all of them.

I'll have a short list ready for Thursday.

Avery

-- 
Avery Brooks
Robotics Engineer | Northwind Robotics
avery.brooks@northwind.example

