Hi Avery,

Welcome! I'm the manufacturing & quality engineer here, I've been with the building since it was Northwind Controls, so if you're ever wondering why something is the way it is, I might know.

Some practical stuff:
- QA lab is in Bay 4. Gauges, the torque analyzer and the reference parts are in the gauge cabinet (GC-1).
- Receiving and the RMA cage are in Bay 5, next to the dock.
- I do a quarterly calibration of all gauges and torque drivers. You'll get an email the week before, just drop yours in the tray.
- Incoming inspection for servos is QP-07, copy on the share under Quality.

Wednesday next week Linda has you with me at receiving, see you then.

Amy

-- 
Amy Chen
