Hi Luis,

Welcome to the team! As promised, the one-page cheat sheet for setting servo IDs is taped next to the ID station. Short version:

1. One servo at a time on the driver board.
2. Run the setup script, it asks for the joint name and writes the ID.
3. Put the numbered dot on the case.
4. Never connect two new servos to the board at once (they're both ID 1).

Ask me or Ben if anything's unclear.

Avery

